## Sources

1. A. A. Markov, "Extension of the law of large numbers to dependent quantities" (1906), translated in O. B. Sheynin
   (ed.), *Probability and Statistics: Russian Papers*, NG Verlag (2004).
2. J. R. Norris, *Markov Chains*, Cambridge University Press (1997), chapter 1.
3. C. M. Grinstead and J. L. Snell, *Introduction to Probability*, 2nd ed., American Mathematical Society (1997),
   chapter 11 (absorbing chains and the fundamental matrix).
4. W. Feller, *An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications*, vol. 1, 3rd ed., Wiley (1968), chapter
   XIV (the gambler's ruin).
